     A*
     A* Corvel Bill Transmission Information
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Created on 08/30/2002 by c:62 for Project 128MAC
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Purpose: This file will hold the member #, date/time uploaded,
     A*          date/time converted, and date/time processed of the
     A*          "batch" of bills received from Corvel.
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Revisions:
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PV901                     TEXT('Corvel Bill Trans Info')
     A            V9NAME    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('Shared folder doc ID')
     A            V9MBR#    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('FAV0P member #')
     A            V9ULDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Date')
     A*           Upload date when FAV9P record created, FAV9P Member
     A*           name assigned
     A*
     A            V9ULTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Time')
     A            V9CVDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Date')
     A*           Convert date when data converted from FAV0P file to
     A*           FAV1P, FAV2P and FAV3P
     A*
     A            V9CVTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Time')
     A            V9PRDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Date')
     A*           Process date when all FAV1P records have a value
     A*           in S1PRFL for a given "batch".  This will prevent
     A*           the document in Corvel from appearing on the "Upload
     A*           Corvel Bills" screen, since all the FAV1P records
     A*           have been processed.  We don't want to process that
     A*           member again.
     A*
     A            V9PRTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Time')
     A*
     A            V9STAT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Status')
     A            V9USER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint User')
     A            V9PGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Program')
     A            V9TIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Time')
     A            V9DT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Date')
     A            V9IUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial User')
     A            V9IPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Program')
     A            V9ITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Time')
     A            V9IDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Date')
